"text": "The gates run on the dev host, Linux. Nothing boots outside the harness: there is no live leg, and the real boot is /implement P3's. The base sha in the guard entry is HEAD as this plan is written, `557f1c98d4e5639ec7e065025d092feda234b3b7`."
